#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Back to the main menu. %hs does the same on every line of this page. Every key and controller "
"button except the 5 menu keys still reaches the game while this menu is open, so you can keep "
"driving."
msgstr ""
"Nazad na glavni meni. %hs radi isto na svakom redu ove stranice. Svaki taster i dugme kontrolera "
"osim 5 tastera menija i dalje stiže do igre dok je meni otvoren, pa možete voziti."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Press ONE new key or controller button for %ls: any key, also another menu key (it is taken from "
"it). Keys / buttons already held now are ignored until released. Esc or Backspace cancels, so "
"does 10 s without a press; menu keys cannot be cleared here."
msgstr ""
"Pritisnite JEDAN novi taster ili dugme kontrolera za %ls: bilo koji taster, i drugi taster menija "
"(oduzima se njemu). Tasteri / dugmad koji su već pritisnuti ignorišu se dok se ne otpuste. Esc "
"ili Backspace otkazuje, kao i 10 s bez pritiska; tasteri menija se ovde ne mogu obrisati."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Press ONE new key (Shift / Ctrl / Alt with it make a combination) or controller button / D-pad "
"direction. Keys / buttons already held now (a shifter gear) are ignored until released; axes "
"never bind. %hs or Esc cancels, Backspace clears to none, 10 s without a press cancels."
msgstr ""
"Pritisnite JEDAN novi taster (Shift / Ctrl / Alt uz njega čine kombinaciju) ili dugme kontrolera "
"/ smer D-pada. Tasteri / dugmad koji su već pritisnuti (stepen menjača) ignorišu se dok se ne "
"otpuste; ose se nikad ne vezuju. %hs ili Esc otkazuje, Backspace briše u none, 10 s bez pritiska "
"otkazuje."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"One of the 5 keys that drive this menu (dlaa.ini %hs). %hs, then press the new key or button: the "
"other menu keys can be taken too. These lines cannot be cleared, and each of the 5 must keep a "
"binding (a press that leaves another one empty is refused). Saved to dlaa.ini at once."
msgstr ""
"Jedan od 5 tastera koji upravljaju ovim menijem (dlaa.ini %hs). %hs, zatim pritisnite novi taster "
"ili dugme: mogu se uzeti i drugi tasteri menija. Ti redovi se ne mogu obrisati, a svaki od 5 mora "
"zadržati vezu (pritisak koji bi ostavio drugi praznim odbija se). Odmah se čuva u dlaa.ini."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%ls (dlaa.ini %hs). %hs, then press the new key or button: a key replaces the Keyboard part, a "
"controller button or D-pad direction the Controller part. A key / button used by another action "
"moves here. Saved to dlaa.ini at once."
msgstr ""
"%ls (dlaa.ini %hs). %hs, zatim pritisnite novi taster ili dugme: taster zamenjuje deo Keyboard, "
"dugme kontrolera ili smer D-pada deo Controller. Taster / dugme druge radnje seli se ovamo. Odmah "
"se čuva u dlaa.ini."

